  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.1.58\n\n## Changes since v0.1.52\n\n- fix: show the job header queued time in local time (#96) (`cb00610`)\n- fix: keep connect and sign-in dialogs open when they fail (#95) (`795aa47`)\n- feat: keep a summary of the last deploy on each project (#94) (`2d9f829`)\n- fix: keep the status bar steady while the coordinator stays healthy (#93) (`2938d08`)\n- fix: report failed GUI commands instead of swallowing or crashing (#90) (`9281e54`)\n- feat: confirm Queue Deploy and set it apart from Queue Build (#89) (`2035d13`)\n",
